; Runs for three seconds with a window that asks before it is closed. tests/cli/close_prompt.py closes it.
; The prompt is set before Graphics and has to outlive EndGraphics, like the title does (the samples of Blitz3D do exactly this).
AppTitle "Close prompt", "Really quit?"
Graphics 64, 64, 0, 2
EndGraphics
Graphics 64, 64, 0, 2
DebugLog "started"
For i = 1 To 300
	Delay 10
Next
DebugLog "survived"
